{"author":"Humanread Founder","chapters":[{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>html{color-scheme:light}body{margin:0;padding:1rem;overflow:auto;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:#17201c;background:#faf8f3}*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}body{background:#0b1526;color:#e8edf5;font-family:\"Noto Serif TC\",serif;\n     display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden}.field{position:absolute;inset:-40px;pointer-events:none}@keyframes twinkle{0%,100%{opacity:.1}50%{opacity:1}}.star{position:absolute;left:8%;top:6%;width:2px;height:2px;background:#fdf6d8;\n      border-radius:50%;animation:twinkle 3s ease-in-out infinite}.window{text-align:center;z-index:5;padding:2rem}.kicker{letter-spacing:.45em;font-size:.72rem;color:#9fb4cc;animation:fadeUp 1.6s ease .2s both}@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1}}h1{margin-top:1.3rem;font-size:3.1rem;letter-spacing:.16em;\n   background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fdf6d8 20%,#ffce7a);\n   -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;\n   animation:fadeUp 1.4s ease .5s both}.sub{margin-top:.9rem;font-size:.95rem;color:#b8c7da;letter-spacing:.25em;\n     animation:fadeUp 1.2s ease 1.3s both}@keyframes swing{0%,100%{transform:rotate(-5deg)}50%{transform:rotate(6deg)}}.lamp{margin-top:1.8rem;font-size:1.9rem;display:inline-block;\n      animation:fadeUp .7s ease 2s both, swing 3s ease-in-out infinite}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}</style></head><body><div class=\"field\"><i class=\"star\"></i></div>\n<div class=\"window\">\n <div class=\"kicker\">一座只收思念的燈塔</div>\n <h1>風的信使</h1>\n <div class=\"sub\">海員把寄不出的話，交給住在燈塔的人。</div>\n <span class=\"lamp\">🏮</span>\n</div>\n</body></html>","id":459,"position":1,"source_type":"sandbox_html","title":"風的信使（開篇）"},{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>html{color-scheme:light}body{margin:0;padding:1rem;overflow:auto;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:#17201c;background:#faf8f3}*{box-sizing:border-box}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;padding:0;height:100%}body{background:#06101f;color:#dfe8f3;font-family:\"Noto Serif TC\",serif;\n     min-height:100vh;display:flex;overflow:hidden}.content{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:32em;margin:10vh 8% auto;}.content p{line-height:2.15;color:#c6d4e4;font-size:.98rem;letter-spacing:.06em;\n           animation:riseIn 1s ease both}@keyframes riseIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)}to{opacity:1}}.content p:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.6s}.content p:nth-child(3){animation-delay:1.3s}.sea{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;height:42vh}.wave{position:absolute;left:-8%;right:-8%;height:84px;\n      background-size:60% 130%;\n      border-radius:50% 50% 40% 55% / 90% 70% 110% 80%;}@keyframes driftA{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0) scaleY(.92)}50%{transform:translateX(-7%) scaleY(1.06)}}.wave.a{bottom:-30px;background:#123a5c;\n        animation:driftA 8s ease-in-out infinite;}@keyframes driftB{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0) scaleY(.96)}50%{transform:translateX(-5%) scaleY(1.05)}}.wave.b{bottom:-14px;height:70px;background:#0d2a44;\n        animation:driftB 10s ease-in-out infinite;}@keyframes driftC{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0) scaleY(.99);opacity:.18}50%{transform:translateX(-4%) scaleY(1.02);opacity:.3}}.wave.c{bottom:6px;height:58px;background:#fdf6d8;\n        animation:driftC 12s ease-in-out infinite;}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}</style></head><body><div class=\"content\">\n  <p>燈塔建在島的盡頭，面朝那片永遠不會安靜下來的海。</p>\n  <p>入夜之後，浪會一層層湧上岸。而住在燈塔的人說，那不是單純的浪聲——</p>\n  <p>那是很多沒有被說完的話，還在岸邊拍打著，等一個可以被聽見的方式。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sea\"><div class=\"wave c\"></div><div class=\"wave b\"></div><div class=\"wave a\"></div></div>\n</body></html>","id":460,"position":2,"source_type":"sandbox_html","title":"海與燈塔"},{"html":"<p>老人住在燈塔裡，誰也說不清他叫什麼名字。大家只曉得，幾十年來他都守著那盞夜夜亮起的燈。</p>\n<p>他的工作很簡單：替海員收信、寄語。</p>\n<p>每當船靠岸，總有那麼一兩個水手走下跳板，從懷裡摸出一張折得很舊的紙，塞到他乾燥的手心裡。不貼郵票，不寫地址——或者只寫一個名字，又或者連名字都沒有。</p>\n<p>「替我把它交給風。」他們說。</p>\n<p>老人點頭，從來不多問。等船開走、燈塔的光掃過海面時，他就會把那些紙一張張攤平在窗台上，讓來自陸地的風把它們帶走。</p>\n<p>他說，風認得每一句話要去的地方——就像海浪認識岸。</p>","id":461,"position":3,"source_type":"markdown","title":"守燈的人"},{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>html{color-scheme:light}body{margin:0;padding:1rem;overflow:auto;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:#17201c;background:#faf8f3}*{box-sizing:border-box}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;padding:0;min-height:100%}body{background:#101c14;color:#e4ecdf;font-family:\"Noto Serif TC\",serif;\n     min-height:100vh;overflow:hidden;}.content{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:31em;margin:9vh 7%;}.stage{position:fixed;inset:0}.sill{position:absolute;right:6%;top:44%;\n      width:180px;height:12px;\n      background:#8a6f46;border-radius:4px;}.paper{position:fixed;width:58px;height:76px;background:#f3ead2;border-radius:3px;\n       box-shadow:0 5px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.35);\n       transform-origin:center bottom}@keyframes leaveA{0%{transform:translate(-40vw,-10vh) rotate(-4deg);opacity:.9}\n                  20%{}100%{transform:translate(55vw,-42vh) rotate(48deg);opacity:.7}}#p1{right:14%;top:30%;animation:leaveA 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate}@keyframes leaveB{0%{transform:translate(-46vw,-6vh) rotate(6deg);opacity:.9}100%{transform:translate(40vw,-48vh) rotate(-36deg);opacity:.7}}#p2{right:20%;top:34%;animation:leaveB 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate .5s}@keyframes leaveC{0%{transform:translate(-38vw,4vh) rotate(12deg);opacity:.9}100%{transform:translate(-28vw,-40vh) rotate(-55deg);opacity:.7}}#p3{right:16%;top:26%;animation:leaveC 13s ease-in-out infinite alternate .2s}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}</style></head><body><div class=\"content\">\n <p>─ 第四章 ─</p>\n <p>他把那些紙張一張、兩張、三張，攤平在窗台上。</p>\n <p id=\"l1\">風從陸地深處吹過來。紙先輕輕顫了一下，像還拿不定主意；接著便一片接一片離開窗沿，飄上海面那道由月光鋪成的路。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stage\"><div class=\"sill\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"paper\" id=\"p1\"> </div>\n<div class=\"paper\" id=\"p2\"> </div>\n<div class=\"paper\" id=\"p3\"> </div>\n</body></html>","id":462,"position":4,"source_type":"sandbox_html","title":"窗台上的紙箋"},{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>html{color-scheme:light}body{margin:0;padding:1rem;overflow:auto;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:#17201c;background:#faf8f3}*{box-sizing:border-box}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;padding:0;min-height:100%}body{background:#04070d;color:#e6ecf4;font-family:\"Noto Serif TC\",serif;\n     min-height:100vh;overflow:hidden;}.content{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:31em;margin:9vh 7%;text-align:left}.content p{line-height:2.15;color:#cfd8e6;font-size:.97rem;animation:fadeIn 1s ease both}@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}.pivot{position:fixed;left:120px;bottom:150px;\n       width:34px;height:48px;z-index:3}.core{border-radius:6px;background:#fff2c8;box-shadow:\n       0 0 18px #ffce7a,0 0 46px rgba(255,206,122,.65)}.glow{position:absolute;inset:-42px -60% ;border-radius:50%;\n      background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(252,226,155,.55),rgba(10,15,30,0) 70%)}.beam{position:fixed;left:120px;bottom:150px;\n      width:460px;height:8px;z-index:2;\n      border-radius:999px;transform-origin:0 50%;\n      background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,233,163,.9),rgba(252,226,155,.18) 70%,transparent);}@keyframes sweep{from{transform:rotate(-60deg)}to{transform:rotate(300deg)}}.beam{animation:sweep 7s linear infinite}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}</style></head><body>\n\n<div class=\"pivot\">\n  <div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <div class=\"core\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"beam\"></div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n  <p>─ 第五章 ─</p>\n  <p>後半夜，老人的燈塔是海面上唯一醒著的光。</p>\n  <p>他沒有替任何一句話留底。他說思念一旦說出口，就該讓它走；留在手裡的心事太多，風便再也抬不動。</p>\n</div>\n\n</body></html>","id":463,"position":5,"source_type":"sandbox_html","title":"燈塔的光"},{"html":"<p>女孩是在深秋那個無風的午後登島的。</p>\n<p>她站在燈塔底下的時候，老人正把最後一疊紙箋送出窗台。海面平靜得不像話，連一片帆影也沒有；而那陣本該把信帶走的陸風，今天偏偏一步都不肯動。</p>\n<p>女孩沒有先開口。她在底下看了很久那扇亮著的圓窗，彷彿在確認什麼，等老人終於走下來開門時，她才問：</p>\n<p>「燈塔的主人，是不是從來不留信的副本？」</p>\n<p>老人的手停在半空的銅門把上。他活了這麼多年，從來沒有人這樣直白地戳中他那件藏在心底的事。</p>\n<p>「是。」他說。「寄出去的，都不留。」</p>\n<p>女孩低下頭。「那我父親那封信呢？」她說。「一封四十年前就該到的信。他說他交給過風，可這四十年來，整個海灣都沒有人收到。」</p>","id":464,"position":6,"source_type":"markdown","title":"風暴以前"},{"html":"<h2>第7章 沒有風的日子</h2>\n<p>老人請女孩進塔。燈火在白晝裡仍然燃著，像一顆不肯承認自己已經過時的星。</p>\n<p>女孩叫林潮音。她父親年輕時曾是海圖抄寫員，替所有船隻標出暗礁與回家的航線。四十年前，他把一封信交給燈塔，信裡只有一句話：如果風願意原諒我，請讓她知道我沒有離開。</p>\n<p>「她是誰？」老人問。</p>\n<p>潮音看著窗外平靜到發白的海。「我母親。她等了一生，臨終前還說，風一定只是迷路了。」</p>","id":471,"position":7,"source_type":"markdown","title":"沒有風的日子"},{"html":"<h2>第9章 逆風的渡船</h2>\n<p>第二天清晨，老人取出多年不用的小船。沒有風，帆便像一片沉默的皮膚垂著。</p>\n<p>潮音坐在船頭，把父親的海圖壓在膝上。老人划槳，槳聲一下一下落進水裡，像把時間重新撥回四十年前。</p>\n<p>他們離開燈塔時，塔頂的燈竟自行轉向。光束沒有照向航道，而是指著海灣最深處的霧。</p>\n<p>老人知道，那不是警示。那是召喚。</p>","id":472,"position":8,"source_type":"markdown","title":"逆風的渡船"},{"html":"<h2>第10章 瓶中潮汐</h2>\n<p>霧裡漂來第一只玻璃瓶。</p>\n<p>瓶中沒有紙條，只有一小撮濕鹽和一聲極輕的嘆息。潮音把瓶口貼近耳邊，聽見一個女人在很遠的地方說：我不是不等，我只是忘了該往哪裡等。</p>\n<p>老人臉色發白。這不是人寫給人的信，而是那些從未抵達的話，在海裡泡到有了自己的聲音。</p>\n<p>若所有失信之語都醒來，風就不只是送信者了。它會變成審判者。</p>","id":473,"position":9,"source_type":"markdown","title":"瓶中潮汐"},{"html":"<h2>第12章 借來的聲音</h2>\n<p>郵局裡住著一個沒有臉的郵差。</p>\n<p>他說自己曾經也是人，只是替太多人保管秘密，最後被秘密磨去了面孔。他告訴老人：風不是迷路，是被某封信留住了。</p>\n<p>「哪一封？」</p>\n<p>郵差抬起空白的臉，像在聽遠處潮聲。「你自己的。」</p>\n<p>老人想起年少時，他也曾寫過一封信，卻在交給風的前一刻，把收信人的名字撕掉。</p>","id":474,"position":10,"source_type":"markdown","title":"借來的聲音"},{"html":"<h2>第13章 收信人的缺口</h2>\n<p>那封無名的信一直卡在風的喉嚨裡。</p>\n<p>因為沒有收信人，風不能送達；因為不能送達，所有經過燈塔的信都開始偏航。老人一生以為自己替別人放手，其實他讓自己的膽怯成了整座海灣的結。</p>\n<p>潮音沒有責備他。她只問：「如果補上名字，父親的信會到嗎？」</p>\n<p>老人說：「也許。但那表示我得承認，我當年不敢寄給誰。」</p>","id":475,"position":11,"source_type":"markdown","title":"收信人的缺口"},{"html":"<h2>第15章 父親的航線</h2>\n<p>信裡沒有潮音想像中的辯解。</p>\n<p>父親只寫：我把所有人的路都畫清楚，卻沒有畫出回到你身邊的那一條。我不是被海留下，是被羞愧留下。若風有一天抵達，請告訴你母親，我每一張海圖最深的藍，都是她窗外的夜。</p>\n<p>潮音讀完後久久沒有說話。</p>\n<p>老人忽然明白，信的目的不一定是改變過去。有時它只是讓等待終於有一個形狀。</p>","id":476,"position":12,"source_type":"markdown","title":"父親的航線"},{"html":"<h2>第16章 缺名的信</h2>\n<p>老人回到塔頂，找出那封被他藏了四十年的信。</p>\n<p>紙已脆黃，撕掉名字的地方像一個小小傷口。他年輕時想寄給的人，是潮音的母親。不是愛情的私語，而是一句沒能說出口的歉意：那年風暴前，他看見潮音的父親改了航線，卻沒有阻止。</p>\n<p>他以為沉默能保護活著的人。</p>\n<p>結果沉默只是讓死者與生者一起迷路。</p>","id":477,"position":13,"source_type":"markdown","title":"缺名的信"},{"html":"<h2>第18章 風的返航</h2>\n<p>天亮以前，海灣所有窗戶都響了一次。</p>\n<p>有人在枕邊找到少年時未寄出的道歉，有人在灶台上看見亡夫最後的叮嚀，也有人收到一張空白紙，紙上只有乾淨的風味，表示對方其實早已放下。</p>\n<p>燈塔不再只把信送出去。</p>\n<p>它開始把迷路的話帶回來。老人明白，自己守的不是光，也不是風，而是人願意面對彼此的那一刻。</p>","id":478,"position":14,"source_type":"markdown","title":"風的返航"},{"html":"<h2>第19章 新的守燈人</h2>\n<p>潮音沒有立刻離島。</p>\n<p>她留下來修補海圖，把每一條曾經斷掉的航線用淡金色標出。老人教她辨認風的重量：愧疚的風低，思念的風暖，真正的告別則輕得幾乎摸不到。</p>\n<p>冬天來臨時，老人把銅鑰匙交給她。</p>\n<p>「燈塔不需要主人。」他說。「只需要有人在風遲到時，還願意點燈。」</p>","id":479,"position":15,"source_type":"markdown","title":"新的守燈人"}],"cover_asset_hash":"670e16aa12dfae03a8afa5e0d53418b63f86791af5fb3a83761e77b8a6cb5271","cover_color":"#c86b4a","metadata":{"age_rating":"all","content_warnings":"","language":"zh-Hant","primary_genre":"literary","secondary_genre":null,"serial_status":"completed","tags":["實驗小說","排版敘事","CSS動畫","互動敘事","短篇小說"],"warning_level":"none"},"novel_id":11,"rights":{"authorization_at":"2026-08-07T03:20:14.363079Z","public_copy_acknowledged":true,"reader_license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","rights_holder_confirmed":true},"slug":"novel-ec2bbd8d-c92349","summary":"一座只收『思念』的燈塔。海員把想說卻寄不出的話寫在紙上，交給住在燈塔的人；他讓風替他把每一句送到該去的地方。關於等待、漂流與那些永遠無法投遞的字。","theme":{"accent_color":"#2a6f97","drop_cap":true,"font":"serif","font_size":18,"line_height":"2.0","paragraph_spacing":"1.4","scene_break":"line","text_align":"left"},"title":"風的信使","translation":null}
